    "sentence_translations": [
      "(4) Friends",
      "",
      "Old Guan didn’t know what to say. She wanted to go to sleep.",
      "",
      "“Old Guan! Did you hear that?” Little Dong asked.",
      "",
      "“I heard. Little Dong, I want to sleep,” Old Guan said.",
      "",
      "“Okay, you go to sleep then. Thank you for talking with me. You are my friend now!” Little Dong smiled.",
      "",
      "“Friend?” Old Guan asked.",
      "",
      "“Can … can you be my friend? Can I call you on the phone?” Little Dong felt a bit embarrassed.",
      "",
      "“Ye … yeah,  f … friend,” Old Guan said.",
      "",
      "“Great! You go to sleep then. Goodbye, Old Guan!” Little Dong was very happy.",
      "",
      "“Goodbye,” Old Guan said.",
      "",
      "Before, Old Guan didn’t have any friends. She also didn’t like talking. She could make friends with one phone call?",
      "Old Guan felt a little happy and also a little unhappy. She didn’t know what was going on.",
      "She thought about it: Little Dong is a child.",
      "Today he just called the wrong number. Presumably, he won’t call again tomorrow."
    ]
